OL,3,GNEWSAMarket wants help to move 'iconic'
OL,4,Ahelter skelter
OL,5,
OL,6,FA market forced to leave its site after
OL,7,F40 years has appealed for help to move
OL,8,Fits "iconic" helter skelter.
OL,10,FSkirlington Market, in Skipsea, East
OL,11,FYorkshire, is moving to a location on
OL,12,Fthe road to Bridlington after approval
OL,13,Fwas granted in July for Unity Holidays
OL,14,Fto build sports facilities on the
OL,15,Fexisting site.
OL,17,FThe market's final event is on 25
OL,18,FOctober before it reopens at its new
OL,19,Fhome in April next year, but its boss
OL,20,Fwants to ensure the spiral slide goes
OL,21,Fwith them.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
